[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 3723.27, "timestamp": "01:02:03", "text": "所以，等等。我本应该按E键。嗯，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3730.829, "timestamp": "01:02:10", "text": "问：呃，是楼主还是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3734.549, "timestamp": "01:02:14", "text": "P？我正在玩游戏。我有P。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3739.03, "timestamp": "01:02:19", "text": "呃，等等。你用“呃呃”这个词吗？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3740.63, "timestamp": "01:02:20", "text": "默认关键点？你的钥匙是什么？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3746.589, "timestamp": "01:02:26", "text": "观点？不，我的手表是 EQ CZ。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3751.51, "timestamp": "01:02:31", "text": "EQ CZ Z。哦，我的拾音器是 E。我的表演是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3756.39, "timestamp": "01:02:36", "text": "问：好的。然后，准备就绪是 C。Ping 是 Z。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3762.069, "timestamp": "01:02:42", "text": "所以 Z 表示：好的。呃，抓取是 Q。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3765.309, "timestamp": "01:02:45", "text": "不，抓取是 E。抓取是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3769.43, "timestamp": "01:02:49", "text": "E. 那么，行为是什么？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3771.71, "timestamp": "01:02:51", "text": "是 Q。我的天哪。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3773.069, "timestamp": "01:02:53", "text": "[音乐]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3777.43, "timestamp": "01:02:57", "text": "咖啡。嘿。嘿。那还不错。我们"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3778.91, "timestamp": "01:02:58", "text": "可以做到"}]